## The achievement catalogue. Each is unlocked by a lifetime stat reaching a
## value ({"stat": name, "value": n}) or by a named moment ({"flag": name}),
## and rewards money (cents), skill points and/or a clothing item, once.
## Achievements never give XP: XP stays a measure of demonstrated learning.
##
## Stats are counted by the Achievements autoload from game events (answers,
## lectures, flashcards, exams, encounters, clubs, money, places visited);
## `level`, `best_streak` and `lectures_completed` are read live.
